<BaseLayout title="Cookies & privacy choices | Zion Creative" description="Cookies & privacy choices for Zion Creative."><Header/><main id="main" class="container policy-page"><h1>Cookies & privacy choices</h1><p>Optional third-party forms, reviews, and scheduling are disabled until you choose to load them. You can continue browsing without enabling them.</p><h2>Your choice</h2><p>Selecting an “Allow” button enables that provider for the current page. This choice is not saved for later visits. To stop the optional embedded service on the current page, select “Disable optional embeds and reload.” Reloading returns the page to its unloaded state. This does not delete information you already submitted or cookies the provider already placed; manage existing cookies in your browser settings.</p><h2>Storage and tracking</h2><p>The website does not include advertising pixels in its source code. Cloudflare supplies a browser beacon on the live site for site traffic and performance measurement. This hosting-level feature operates separately from the optional embed buttons. Cloudflare also provides hosting and security and may process technical request information. See <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/about/">Cloudflare’s Web Analytics documentation</a> and <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">privacy policy</a>.</p><p>Once enabled, Elfsight or Calendly may use its own cookies and browser storage. Read the provider notices linked beside each allow button before loading a service. Provider behavior can change independently of this website.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For questions, use <a href="mailto:hello@zioncreative.co">hello@zioncreative.co</a> or <a href="tel:+12177252031">217.725.2031</a>. Read the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> for more information.</p></main><Footer/></BaseLayout>
